"hero": "\n<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\">{{ppp:breadcrumbs}}<span class=\"eyebrow\">Ellis Services Group · Perth</span><h1>Power Point Installation &amp; Repairs Perth</h1><aside class=\"intent-safety\" data-intent-safety><p><strong>Electrical danger comes before booking.</strong> For a shock or tingling tap, keep clear and call <a href=\"tel:131351\">Western Power 13 13 51</a>. For a life-threatening emergency or fire, call <a href=\"tel:000\">000</a>. <a href=\"https://www.westernpower.com.au/issues-enquiries/reporting-incidents-and-emergencies/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Official emergency guidance</a>. For loss of supply, check <a href=\"https://www.westernpower.com.au/issues-enquiries/reporting-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Western Power outage reporting</a> before assuming an internal circuit fault.</p></aside><p class=\"expanded-lead\">Power point installation, replacement and repairs in Perth for homes, rentals and managed properties. We assess damaged outlets, failed switches and proposed new points, then confirm the electrical scope and written quote.</p><p><a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=power-points-perth.html\">Arrange a visit &amp; quote</a></p><p class=\"expanded-hours\">Routine service hours: 09:00–21:00, seven days a week. 24-hour emergency repairs are available; call to confirm attendance arrangements and the quoted emergency work. No arrival time is guaranteed.</p><nav aria-label=\"On this page\" class=\"expanded-toc\"><a href=\"#service-scope\">Service scope</a><a href=\"#service-scenarios\">Common situations</a><a href=\"#service-quote\">Process &amp; quote</a><a href=\"#service-faq\">FAQs</a></nav></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"sections": [
{
"id": "section-1",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-scope\">Power point installation Perth: service scope</h2><ul><li>Investigate and repair failed power points and light switches.</li><li>Replace damaged outlets and quote for additional or relocated power points.</li><li>Assess intended load, existing circuits and indoor or outdoor location before specifying work.</li><li>Appliance internal repairs and major rewiring are not assumed to be part of an outlet repair.</li></ul><p>We confirm the property, installation and requested outcome before selecting the work. Fixed plumbing and electrical tasks are handled by the appropriate qualified trade; a coordinated visit does not make every task interchangeable. Current documentation relevant to the proposed work can be requested privately.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"electrical.html\">Perth electrical services</a></li><li><a href=\"lighting-power-points-perth.html\">Combined lighting and outlet overview</a></li><li><a href=\"lighting-installation-perth.html\">Light fitting and lighting work</a></li><li><a href=\"power-faults-perth.html\">Partial power loss investigation</a></li><li><a href=\"safety-switch-tripping-perth.html\">Tripping safety switch repairs</a></li><li><a href=\"service-areas.html\">Perth service regions</a></li></ul></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-2",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section expanded-scenarios\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-scenarios\">Common situations and what to report</h2><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>Power points not working but lights still work</h3><p>A kitchen outlet or several power points can stop working while lighting remains on. This may involve different circuits or a fault in the affected installation. Note which outlets are affected without opening them; a working light does not prove an outlet is safe.</p></div><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>Adding a double power point</h3><p>Tell us the proposed position and the equipment you want to use. An existing nearby point does not establish circuit suitability. Access, cable routes and the existing protection need assessment before adding or relocating an outlet.</p></div><p>These are illustrative situations, not customer case studies or diagnoses. Report what you have noticed; you do not need to identify the cause before contacting us.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-3",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-quote\">Assessment, work plan and written quote</h2><ol class=\"expanded-steps\"><li><strong>Describe the job.</strong> Give the suburb, affected equipment or planned installation, when it began and whether the condition is worsening. Add safe access and the person who can approve the work.</li><li><strong>Assess the installation.</strong> We check the relevant equipment and connections on site. Concealed work, product compatibility and the cause of a fault cannot be guaranteed from an enquiry or photograph.</li><li><strong>Agree the scope.</strong> The written quote identifies attendance or investigation, the selected equipment, materials and agreed work. Confirm GST, disposal, access, testing and any making good that applies to the specific job.</li><li><strong>Approve changes separately.</strong> If findings change the required work, we explain the additional scope and charge before proceeding. Confirm the checks and completion information needed for a rental or managed property.</li></ol><p>Published standard-hours guide ranges elsewhere on this site are not a fixed price for this unseen job. Emergency repair charges follow the quoted plan. There is no assumed free attendance, unlimited investigation or universal hourly rate.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "service-faq",
"kind": "faq",
"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq\" id=\"service-faq\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Power Point Installation &amp; Repairs Perth FAQs</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><h3>Prepare the request and approval</h3><p>Give the property location, observable symptoms or intended installation, access contact and the person who can approve the work. The agreed quote sets out the assessment and work; submitting a form does not reserve an appointment.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"electrical.html\">Perth electrical services</a></li><li><a href=\"lighting-power-points-perth.html\">Combined lighting and outlet overview</a></li><li><a href=\"lighting-installation-perth.html\">Light fitting and lighting work</a></li><li><a href=\"power-faults-perth.html\">Partial power loss investigation</a></li><li><a href=\"safety-switch-tripping-perth.html\">Tripping safety switch repairs</a></li><li><a href=\"dishwasher-installation-perth.html\">Dishwasher Installation &amp; Connections Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"switchboard-upgrades-perth.html\">Switchboard Repairs &amp; Upgrades Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"emergency-electrician-perth.html\">24-Hour Emergency Electrician Perth</a></li></ul></div><!-- site-intent:end --><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:3:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:3:answer}}</details></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
